    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7472" root="حذو" body-key="H">
    
      6 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَحَاذَا</span></b>  <i>They were,</i> or <i>became, over against,</i>
or <i>opposite to, each other; they faced,</i> or <i>fronted,
each other.</i> ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And <i>They matched each other;
each of them was,</i> or <i>became, the match, fellow,</i>
or <i>equal, of the other.</i>] ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">التَّحَاذِى</span> in selling
and buying: see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">التَّرَاوُضُ</span>. [This, perhaps, may
belong to art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حذى</span>.]

